nted_image\', \'mask\']\n\n--- STATISTICAL CONTRASTIVE SAMPLES (AGENT 0 REFERENCE) ---\n[TOP_SUCCESS SAMPLE]: {\'image_path\': \'/fs/ess/PAS2699/digitalAgEdu_datasets/skin_cancer_dataset/benign/1539.jpg\', \'ground_truth\': \'benign\', \'predicted_class\': \'benign\', \'probabilities\': \'[0.9997135996818542, 0.00028640046366490424]\', \'segmented_image\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/segmented/1539_segmented_20260816_161546.png\', \'mask\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/masks/1539_mask_20260816_161546.png\'}\n[HARD_FAILURE SAMPLE]: {\'image_path\': \'/fs/ess/PAS2699/digitalAgEdu_datasets/skin_cancer_dataset/benign/1649.jpg\', \'ground_truth\': \'benign\', \'predicted_class\': \'malignant\', \'probabilities\': \'[0.06674934923648834, 0.9332506060600281]\', \'segmented_image\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/segmented/1649_segmented_20260816_161545.png\', \'mask\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/masks/1649_mask_20260816_161545.png\'}\n[BOUNDARY_UNCERTAINTY SAMPLE]: {\'image_path\': \'/fs/ess/PAS2699/digitalAgEdu_datasets/skin_cancer_dataset/benign/1303.jpg\', \'ground_truth\': \'benign\', \'predicted_class\': \'malignant\', \'probabilities\': \'[0.4979613125324249, 0.5020386576652527]\', \'segmented_image\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/segmented/1303_segmented_20260816_161546.png\', \'mask\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/masks/1303_mask_20260816_161546.png\'}\n[MINORITY_SAMPLE SAMPLE]: {\'image_path\': \'/fs/ess/PAS2699/digitalAgEdu_datasets/skin_cancer_dataset/benign/1135.jpg\', \'ground_truth\': \'benign\', \'predicted_class\': \'benign\', \'probabilities\': \'[0.8938645720481873, 0.10613547265529633]\', \'segmented_image\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/segmented/1135_segmented_20260816_161534.png\', \'mask\': \'./output/skin_cancer_v1/images/masks/1135_mask_20260816_161534.png\'}\n\nFORMULATION DIRECTIVES:\n1. Analyze Phase 1 telemetry (error counts, class imbalance, precision/recall per class, and contrastive samples).\n2. Formulate a real